##### SoloModule Series

Select the **SoloModule** that matches the crop category you want to grow. 

##### AeroHerb  
*solo*

A compact aeroponic cube tuned for oil-rich herbs. Roots hang in a cool nutrient fog under NanoSunBeam™ LEDs that spike blue wavelengths to boost terpene density, while PureLight™ glazing holds canopy temperature steady.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Aromatic herbs – all 15 varieties  
